msgid ""
"Click <strong>+ Add</strong>, then <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Klik <strong>+ Add</strong>, lalu <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:612
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link above and click <strong>Continue</strong>. Keep the "
"sign-in settings Claude detects (either OAuth client option works) and click "
"<strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Beri nama, tempel tautan di atas, lalu klik <strong>Continue</strong>. "
"Pertahankan pengaturan masuk yang dideteksi Claude (kedua opsi klien OAuth "
"berfungsi), lalu klik <strong>Add</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:613
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link from step 1 and click <strong>Continue</strong>. "
"Keep the sign-in settings Claude detects (either OAuth client option works) "
"and click <strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Beri nama, tempel tautan dari langkah 1, lalu klik <strong>Continue</"
"strong>. Pertahankan pengaturan masuk yang dideteksi Claude (kedua opsi "
"klien OAuth berfungsi), lalu klik <strong>Add</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:668
msgid ""
"This site runs on your computer, so the cloud connector cannot reach it. "
"Claude Desktop connects through a <strong>local bridge</strong> instead: the "
"open-source <code>mcp-remote</code> package, started with <code>npx</code> "
"(needs Node.js). It signs in in your browser, and nothing is exposed to the "
"internet."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini berjalan di komputer Anda, sehingga konektor cloud tidak dapat "
"menjangkaunya. Claude Desktop terhubung lewat <strong>jembatan lokal</"
"strong>: paket sumber terbuka <code>mcp-remote</code>, dijalankan dengan "
"<code>npx</code> (perlu Node.js). Masuk dilakukan di peramban Anda, dan "
"tidak ada yang terekspos ke internet."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:670
