msgid ""
"You already run this site through your AI. Hub does the same across every "
"site you manage: content, plugin updates with backup and rollback, malware "
"clean-up, speed, SEO, accessibility, client reports. Any host, any AI app, "
"nothing has to move. This free plugin stays free."
msgstr "Anda sudah menjalankan situs ini lewat AI. Hub melakukan hal yang sama di setiap situs yang Anda kelola: konten, pembaruan plugin dengan cadangan dan pengembalian, pembersihan malware, kecepatan, SEO, aksesibilitas, laporan klien. Hosting apa pun, aplikasi AI apa pun, tidak ada yang perlu dipindahkan. Plugin gratis ini tetap gratis."

#: admin/class-mcp-hub-promo.php:91
msgid "One prompt, every site, every task"
msgstr "Satu perintah, setiap situs, setiap tugas"

#: admin/class-mcp-hub-promo.php:92
msgid "Ten sites or a hundred, one request"
msgstr "Sepuluh situs atau seratus, satu permintaan"

#: admin/class-mcp-hub-promo.php:93
msgid "Works even if the site is down"
msgstr "Tetap bekerja meski situs sedang down"

#: admin/class-mcp-hub-promo.php:94
msgid "Schedule changes across the whole fleet"
msgstr "Jadwalkan perubahan di semua situs Anda"

#: admin/class-mcp-hub-promo.php:97
msgid "Get early access"
msgstr "Dapatkan akses awal"

#: admin/class-mcp-hub-promo.php:103
msgid "Hide the Cowboy Hub banner"
msgstr "Sembunyikan banner Cowboy Hub"

#: admin/class-mcp-hub-promo.php:124
msgid "Manage multiple sites? <b>Check out Cowboy Hub</b>"
msgstr "Mengelola banyak situs? <b>Lihat Cowboy Hub</b>"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1129
msgid "Unknown client"
msgstr "Klien tidak dikenal"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1539
msgid "The OAuth connector is not enabled on this site."
msgstr "Konektor OAuth tidak diaktifkan di situs ini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1585
msgid ""
"This site has no record of this app — it was revoked here, or the site's "
"database was restored or copied from another site. To let it connect again: "
"open Settings > Cowboy MCP > Connections in WordPress and click \"Enable for "
"30 minutes\" in the notice about this app, then reconnect in the app and "
"approve it here."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak memiliki catatan tentang aplikasi ini — aplikasi dicabut di "
"sini, atau basis data situs dipulihkan atau disalin dari situs lain. Agar "
"bisa terhubung lagi: buka Pengaturan > Cowboy MCP > Koneksi di WordPress dan "
"klik \"Aktifkan selama 30 menit\" pada pemberitahuan tentang aplikasi ini, "
"lalu hubungkan kembali di aplikasi dan setujui di sini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1605 includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1630
msgid "Invalid redirect_uri for this client."
msgstr "redirect_uri tidak valid untuk klien ini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1614
msgid "You must be an administrator to authorize this connection."
msgstr "Anda harus menjadi administrator untuk mengotorisasi koneksi ini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1642
msgid ""
"This connection request is missing a required security parameter (PKCE "
"S256). Start the connection again from your AI app."
msgstr ""
"Permintaan koneksi ini tidak memiliki parameter keamanan wajib (PKCE S256). "
"Mulai lagi koneksi dari aplikasi AI Anda."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1646
msgid ""
"This connection request is for a different address than this site's MCP "
"endpoint. Check the server URL in your AI app."
msgstr ""
"Permintaan koneksi ini ditujukan ke alamat yang berbeda dari endpoint MCP "
"situs ini. Periksa URL server di aplikasi AI Anda."

#. translators: %s: host name the app asked to be sent back to
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1655
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This connection would send you to %s, which is not an allowed destination on "
"this site. If you trust that app, an administrator can add its host under "
"Settings > Cowboy MCP > Settings > Browser sign-in."
msgstr ""
"Koneksi ini akan mengirim Anda ke %s, yang bukan tujuan yang diizinkan di "
"situs ini. Jika Anda memercayai aplikasi tersebut, administrator dapat "
"menambahkan host-nya di Pengaturan > Cowboy MCP > Pengaturan > Masuk lewat "
"peramban."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1668
msgid "Security check failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan keamanan gagal. Silakan coba lagi."

#. translators: %s: host name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1760
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This app identifies itself with a document hosted on %s, which is not a "
"known AI-app host on this site. If you trust that app, an administrator can "
"add its host under Settings > Cowboy MCP > Settings > Browser sign-in."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi ini mengidentifikasi dirinya dengan dokumen yang dihosting di %s, "
"yang bukan host aplikasi AI yang dikenal di situs ini. Jika Anda memercayai "
"aplikasi tersebut, administrator dapat menambahkan host-nya di Pengaturan > "
"Cowboy MCP > Pengaturan > Masuk lewat peramban."

#. translators: %s: host name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1763
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This app's identity document on %s points to a private or unreachable "
"address, so it was not fetched."
msgstr ""
"Dokumen identitas aplikasi ini di %s mengarah ke alamat privat atau tidak "
"terjangkau, sehingga tidak diambil."

#. translators: %s: host name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1767
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site could not download the app's identity document from %s. Check that "
"the site can make outbound HTTPS requests, then start the connection again "
"from your AI app."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak dapat mengunduh dokumen identitas aplikasi dari %s. Pastikan "
"situs dapat mengirim permintaan HTTPS keluar, lalu mulai lagi koneksi dari "
"aplikasi AI Anda."

#. translators: %s: host name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1770
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The app's identity document on %s is invalid, so this connection was "
"refused. Start the connection again from your AI app; if it keeps failing, "
"the app vendor has to fix the document."
msgstr ""
"Dokumen identitas aplikasi di %s tidak valid, sehingga koneksi ini ditolak. "
"Mulai lagi koneksi dari aplikasi AI Anda; jika terus gagal, penyedia "
"aplikasi harus memperbaiki dokumennya."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1778
msgid "Connection error"
msgstr "Kesalahan koneksi"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1785
msgid "An application"
msgstr "Sebuah aplikasi"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1817
msgid "Authorize connection"
msgstr "Otorisasi koneksi"

#. translators: %s: application/client name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1828
#, php-format
msgid "%s wants to connect"
msgstr "%s ingin terhubung"

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1832
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It will be able to read and manage %s through the MCP server, acting with "
"your administrator permissions."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi ini akan dapat membaca dan mengelola %s melalui server MCP, "
"bertindak dengan izin administrator Anda."

#. translators: %s: WordPress username
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1837
#, php-format
msgid "Authorizing as %s"
msgstr "Mengotorisasi sebagai %s"

#. translators: %s: host name of the address the browser is sent to after approval, e.g. chatgpt.com
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1842
#, php-format
msgid "After you approve, you will be sent to %s"
msgstr "Setelah Anda menyetujui, Anda akan diarahkan ke %s"

#. translators: %s: host name the identity document was fetched from, e.g. claude.ai
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1847
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Identity published by %s. Approve only if you just started this connection "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Identitas diterbitkan oleh %s. Setujui hanya jika Anda sendiri baru saja "
"memulai koneksi ini."

#. translators: %s: the app's sign-in host, e.g. oauth-redirect.googleusercontent.com
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1852
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The app is named after its sign-in address (%s). Approve only if you just "
"started this connection yourself."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi ini dinamai sesuai alamat masuknya (%s). Setujui hanya jika Anda "
"baru saja memulai koneksi ini sendiri."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1855
msgid ""
"The app name above is supplied by the app and is not verified. Approve only "
"if you just started this connection yourself."
msgstr ""
"Nama aplikasi di atas diberikan oleh aplikasi itu sendiri dan tidak "
"diverifikasi. Setujui hanya jika Anda baru saja memulai koneksi ini sendiri."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1858
msgid ""
"This site has no stored record of this connection. That is normal after a "
"database restore or a staging sync. If you did not just start this from your "
"AI app, choose Deny."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak memiliki catatan tersimpan tentang koneksi ini. Hal ini "
"wajar setelah pemulihan database atau sinkronisasi staging. Jika Anda tidak "
"baru saja memulainya dari aplikasi AI Anda, pilih Tolak."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1860
msgid ""
"This site has no record of this app. Approving registers it here and sends "
"you to the address above. That is expected after you revoked the app on this "
"site, or after a database restore or staging sync. If you did not just start "
"this from your AI app, choose Deny."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak memiliki catatan tentang aplikasi ini. Menyetujui akan "
"mendaftarkannya di sini dan mengirim Anda ke alamat di atas. Itu wajar "
"setelah Anda mencabut aplikasi di situs ini, atau setelah pemulihan basis "
"data atau sinkronisasi staging. Jika Anda tidak baru saja memulainya dari "
"aplikasi AI Anda, pilih Tolak."

#. translators: %d: number of tools allowed in the connection's current custom scope
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1878
#, php-format
msgid "Keep current custom scope (%d tools)"
msgstr "Pertahankan cakupan kustom saat ini (%d alat)"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1884
msgid "Full access — read and manage the site"
msgstr "Akses penuh — baca dan kelola situs"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1888
msgid "Read-only — inspect the site, make no changes"
msgstr "Hanya baca — periksa situs, tanpa membuat perubahan"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1892
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Tolak"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1893
msgid "Approve"
msgstr "Setujui"

#. translators: %s: redirect URI
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1898
#, php-format
msgid "Redirects to: %s"
msgstr "Mengalihkan ke: %s"
